# image offset  action   (r = draw-time redirect only, never in place; s = leave Japanese)
# date line: year suffix and month table (1-9 are three bytes, 10-12 four)
0a48b w ,
0d3b6 w JAN
0d3ba w FEB
0d3be w MAR
0d3c2 w APR
0d3c6 w MAY
0d3ca w JUN
0d3ce w JUL
0d3d2 w AUG
0d3d6 w SEP
0d3da w OCT
0d3df w NOV
0d3e4 w DEC
# currency unit: also drawn by the number routine, which reads two-byte characters only;
# keep the Japanese bytes in memory and swap only when the text routines draw it
12153 r
# currency unit after amounts: four half-width characters in FEh form
0ac5c h CB
0b5d7 h CB
0cd60 h CB
