# house menu: the aligner paired it with an unrelated two-line DOS label; the second tier covers it
0d1a0 s
0d1b4 s
# house attitude levels (one or two kanji each): our own labels, swapped in when drawn
0ad4f t HOSTILE
0ad54 t POOR
0ad57 t NEUTRAL
0ad5a t GOOD
0ad5d t LOYAL
# first mech-name table: the DOS build splits two names over two strings
0adf9 t PHOENIX HAWK
0ae07 t SHADOW HAWK
# options menu: "resume game" item was paired with an unrelated DOS label
122d3 s
